    },
    "text.13c0eea078d7": {
      "comment": "DeviceInfoView — 写 cli-config（CLI）与 permissions.json 的 terminalAllowlist（Agent TUI「Not in allowlist」层）；分见官方文档。均先备份为 .ahakey.bak。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
