        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No AhaKey Codex hook block found in %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.2be886227434": {
      "comment": "AgentManager — LaunchAgent 的 plist 已保存，但 launchctl load 失败，守护进程未载入。\n\nlaunchctl 输出：\n%@\n\n常见原因：同一 Label 已存在、plist 无效、对 ~/Library/LaunchAgents 无写权限。可先点「卸载」再装，或在「控制台」搜索 %@。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LaunchAgent 的 plist 已保存，但 launchctl load 失败，守护进程未载入。\n\nlaunchctl 输出：\n%@\n\n常见原因：同一 Label 已存在、plist 无效、对 ~/Library/LaunchAgents 无写权限。可先点「卸载」再装，或在「控制台」搜索 %@。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LaunchAgent plist saved, but launchctl load failed and the daemon was not loaded.\n\nlaunchctl output:\n%@\n\nPossible causes: duplicate Label, invalid plist or no write access to ~/Library/LaunchAgents. Try uninstalling and reinstalling, or search Console for %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.2c7116d872d6": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 超过固件单键宏 98 字节 / 49 步上限，同步时会被拒绝。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过固件单键宏 98 字节 / 49 步上限，同步时会被拒绝。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exceeds the firmware limit of 98 bytes / 49 steps per key. Sync will be rejected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.2c91fd0c1dd8": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — macOS 原生语音默认 F18；Typeless / 微信的 Fn 触发使用 F19。",
