    "text.2ecb45a3b309": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 拨杆在 IDE 中生效需先安装 Agent 与 Hook，并把蓝牙交给 Agent；否则仅为状态显示。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
