            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拨杆在 IDE 中生效需先安装 Agent 与 Hook，并把蓝牙交给 Agent；否则仅为状态显示。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To control IDE approval, install the Agent and hooks and hand Bluetooth to the Agent. Otherwise this only displays status."
          }
        }
      }
    },
