    "text.3c903a76ea4e": {
      "comment": "AgentManager — 已写回：%@（备份为 %@.ahakey.bak）\n\n本次在 terminalAllowlist 中新增合并 %@ 条前缀；用于 Agent 内「Not in allowlist」层，与 cli-config 的 Shell(...) 是两套。文档：\nhttps://cursor.com/docs/reference/permissions",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已写回：%@（备份为 %@.ahakey.bak）\n\n本次在 terminalAllowlist 中新增合并 %@ 条前缀；用于 Agent 内「Not in allowlist」层，与 cli-config 的 Shell(...) 是两套。文档：\nhttps://cursor.com/docs/reference/permissions"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updated: %@ (backup: %@.ahakey.bak)\n\nAdded %@ prefixes to terminalAllowlist for the Agent's “Not in allowlist” layer. This is separate from cli-config Shell(...) rules. Documentation:\nhttps://cursor.com/docs/reference/permissions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
