    "text.522df322a58a": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyBLEManager — Kimi：若已安装 AhaKey Kimi Hooks，自动档会直接接管当前会话批准；若刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli，请先重开一次 kimi。Claude/Cursor/Codex 仍走各自钩子。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kimi：若已安装 AhaKey Kimi Hooks，自动档会直接接管当前会话批准；若刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli，请先重开一次 kimi。Claude/Cursor/Codex 仍走各自钩子。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kimi: with AhaKey Kimi Hooks installed, auto mode controls approval in the current session. Restart Kimi after installing hooks or upgrading kimi-cli. Claude/Cursor/Codex use their own hooks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.5273a691e14a": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 当前由本 App 占用蓝牙。请打开下方「设备信息…」，在「蓝牙连接」里选「由 Agent 占用」后再启 Agent；与设备信息里「启动」按钮规则一致。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前由本 App 占用蓝牙。请打开下方「设备信息…」，在「蓝牙连接」里选「由 Agent 占用」后再启 Agent；与设备信息里「启动」按钮规则一致。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app owns Bluetooth. Open Device Information below, select Agent under Bluetooth Connection, then start it. This follows the same rules as the Start button there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.52eb493edd1c": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 直接按键设置主键，点击箭头展开下拉列表。",
