    "text.72eb4ff2b6f1": {
      "comment": "FirmwareFlasherView — 此操作将清空 AhaKey X1 的 CodeFlash 和全部 DataFlash 配置。确认固件文件及 SHA-256 无误，并确保烧录期间不会拔线或退出 App。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作将清空 AhaKey X1 的 CodeFlash 和全部 DataFlash 配置。确认固件文件及 SHA-256 无误，并确保烧录期间不会拔线或退出 App。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will erase AhaKey X1 CodeFlash and all DataFlash settings. Confirm the firmware file and SHA-256, and do not disconnect the cable or quit while flashing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.72f36c5de26d": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 点完元件 → Inspector 显示「修改」按钮。点「修改」会接管 BLE 进入编辑态；改完点「写入键盘」写入配置，点「返回」退出编辑。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点完元件 → Inspector 显示「修改」按钮。点「修改」会接管 BLE 进入编辑态；改完点「写入键盘」写入配置，点「返回」退出编辑。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select a component, then Edit in the inspector to take BLE control. Select Write to Keyboard to save configuration, or Back to leave editing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
