    "text.74f2ce67ddc5": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 打开「权限诊断」可以看到 Agent 自检结果：\n• LaunchAgent 已注册：login item 装好\n• 进程在跑：launchd 拉起了 ahakeyconfig-agent\n• Hook 已配置：Claude/Cursor/Codex/Kimi 的 .json / settings 都加好了 ahakey-hook 引用",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开「权限诊断」可以看到 Agent 自检结果：\n• LaunchAgent 已注册：login item 装好\n• 进程在跑：launchd 拉起了 ahakeyconfig-agent\n• Hook 已配置：Claude/Cursor/Codex/Kimi 的 .json / settings 都加好了 ahakey-hook 引用"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permission Diagnostics shows Agent health:\n• LaunchAgent registered: login job installed\n• Process running: launchd started ahakeyconfig-agent\n• Hooks configured: Claude/Cursor/Codex/Kimi settings include AhaKey hooks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
