    "text.9fd2f730247f": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 自动批准：**Claude / Codex PermissionRequest**，**Cursor preToolUse**（含 cli-config）。**Kimi**：安装过 AhaKey Kimi Hooks 后，拨杆会直接接管**当前会话**的自动批准；刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli 时，重开一次 kimi 即可。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动批准：**Claude / Codex PermissionRequest**，**Cursor preToolUse**（含 cli-config）。**Kimi**：安装过 AhaKey Kimi Hooks 后，拨杆会直接接管**当前会话**的自动批准；刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli 时，重开一次 kimi 即可。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic approval: Claude / Codex PermissionRequest and Cursor preToolUse (including cli-config). With AhaKey Kimi Hooks installed, the switch controls the current Kimi session. Restart Kimi after installing hooks or upgrading kimi-cli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
