    "text.c18edf8127c9": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 若系统里已勾选允许，本应用仍显示未开启：请完全退出 AhaKey Studio 并再启动一次。输入监控、辅助功能等常按进程生效，只点「重新检查」或从后台切回，有时读到的仍是旧状态，重启后即可与系统设置一致。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若系统里已勾选允许，本应用仍显示未开启：请完全退出 AhaKey Studio 并再启动一次。输入监控、辅助功能等常按进程生效，只点「重新检查」或从后台切回，有时读到的仍是旧状态，重启后即可与系统设置一致。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If access is allowed in System Settings but still appears disabled here, fully quit and reopen Studio. Input Monitoring and Accessibility may retain their previous state for the current process; checking again or returning from the background may not refresh them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
