    "text.c826bc275c16": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — Agent 就绪时 Claude/Cursor/Codex 可随拨杆走批准。**Kimi**：安装过 AhaKey Kimi Hooks 后，拨杆会直接接管当前会话；若刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli，重开一次 kimi 即可。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent 就绪时 Claude/Cursor/Codex 可随拨杆走批准。**Kimi**：安装过 AhaKey Kimi Hooks 后，拨杆会直接接管当前会话；若刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli，重开一次 kimi 即可。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the Agent is ready, Claude/Cursor/Codex follow the switch. With AhaKey Kimi Hooks installed, Kimi's current session also follows it. Restart Kimi after installing hooks or upgrading kimi-cli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
