    "text.d87a85a910aa": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — Claude：PermissionRequest allow。Cursor：preToolUse 等与 cli-config。Codex：PermissionRequest allow。Kimi：安装过 AhaKey Kimi Hooks 后，**拨杆会直接接管当前会话的自动批准**；若刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli，请**完全关闭并重新打开一次 kimi**。钩子 stdout 只对 **`permissionDecision: deny`** 有特殊拦截语义。Agent 须在跑且蓝牙由其占用。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude：PermissionRequest allow。Cursor：preToolUse 等与 cli-config。Codex：PermissionRequest allow。Kimi：安装过 AhaKey Kimi Hooks 后，**拨杆会直接接管当前会话的自动批准**；若刚装完或刚升级 kimi-cli，请**完全关闭并重新打开一次 kimi**。钩子 stdout 只对 **`permissionDecision: deny`** 有特殊拦截语义。Agent 须在跑且蓝牙由其占用。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude: PermissionRequest allow. Cursor: preToolUse and cli-config. Codex: PermissionRequest allow. With AhaKey Kimi Hooks installed, the switch directly controls approval for the current Kimi session. Restart Kimi after installing hooks or upgrading kimi-cli. Hook stdout only intercepts permissionDecision: deny. The Agent must be running and own Bluetooth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
