      }
    },
    "text.eaf4d49e8193": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — • macOS 原生转写：在地化语言识别，识别完 ⌘V 写回光标。适合任何输入框\n• Fn/Globe：用于 Typeless、微信语音、豆包输入法，在对应软件内把快捷键设为 Fn/Globe\n• 自定义快捷键：只写入键盘，不接管为固定语音预设\n• AhaType：先识别再优化提示词（需登录）",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• macOS 原生转写：在地化语言识别，识别完 ⌘V 写回光标。适合任何输入框\n• Fn/Globe：用于 Typeless、微信语音、豆包输入法，在对应软件内把快捷键设为 Fn/Globe\n• 自定义快捷键：只写入键盘，不接管为固定语音预设\n• AhaType：先识别再优化提示词（需登录）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• macOS speech recognition: recognizes the local language and pastes with ⌘V into any text field\n• Fn/Globe: for Typeless, WeChat Voice and Doubao; select Fn/Globe in that app\n• Custom shortcut: written to the keyboard without a fixed voice preset\n• AhaType: refines text after recognition (sign-in required)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.eafc15bd38a9": {
