    "text.f4f21d3d8251": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyStudioView — 当拨杆 = auto (switchState=0) 时，固件把部分 state 强制改成彩虹效果：\n• PreToolUse / PermissionRequest → 整条彩虹波浪\n• PostToolUse / UserPromptSubmit → 单点彩虹流水\n这就是你看到「Cursor 一跑灯条变彩虹」的原因——是 auto 档的视觉提示，不是 Cursor 专属。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当拨杆 = auto (switchState=0) 时，固件把部分 state 强制改成彩虹效果：\n• PreToolUse / PermissionRequest → 整条彩虹波浪\n• PostToolUse / UserPromptSubmit → 单点彩虹流水\n这就是你看到「Cursor 一跑灯条变彩虹」的原因——是 auto 档的视觉提示，不是 Cursor 专属。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In auto mode (switchState=0), firmware overrides some states with rainbow effects:\n• PreToolUse / PermissionRequest → Full rainbow wave\n• PostToolUse / UserPromptSubmit → Single-point rainbow chase\nThese indicate auto mode, not a Cursor-specific effect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "text.f568c84e88be": {
      "comment": "AhaKeyBLEManager — Claude / Cursor / Codex：按各自确认链。Kimi：若已安装 AhaKey Kimi Hooks，手动档会直接把当前会话拉回手动批准。",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude / Cursor / Codex：按各自确认链。Kimi：若已安装 AhaKey Kimi Hooks，手动档会直接把当前会话拉回手动批准。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude / Cursor / Codex use their normal confirmation flows. With AhaKey Kimi Hooks installed, manual mode returns the current Kimi session to manual approval."
          }
        }
      }
    },
